  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lundazi DWDA Cooking oil Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (Oilseeds).Beneficiaries: Farmers.Location: Lundazi, Eastern Province.Summary: Through this expansion grant, Lundazi District Women Development Association will expand their oilseed production and cooking oil business. The grant will be used to expand production capacity including storage capacity, transport, additional production equipment, and an expanded seed fund.</narrative>
